{"ticker":{"symbol":"008930.KS","name":"한미사이언스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":51600.0,"change_pct":-0.058394160583941646,"market_cap":3497790537728.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.005813953488372093,"week52_low":25600.0,"week52_high":63800.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Distribution","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":492,"website":"https://www.hanmiscience.co.kr","business_summary":"Hanmi Science Co., Ltd., through its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells pharmaceutical products in Korea and internationally. It develops drugs in the areas of diabetes and anti-cancer, as well as children's and adult's bowel preparation and cold medicines, and cephalosporin antibiotics. The company also offers general foods, health functional foods, soy milk, and medical equipment. In addition, it offers automated drug management systems. The company sells its products through online and offline pharmacies. The company was formerly known as Hanmi Holdings Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Hanmi Science Co., Ltd. in March 2012. Hanmi Science Co., Ltd. was founded in 1973 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"한미사이언스(주)는 자회사를 통해 국내외에서 의약품을 제조 및 판매하고 있습니다. 당뇨병, 항암 분야의 의약품을 개발하고 있으며, 소아 및 성인용 장정제제, 감기약, 세팔로스포린계 항생제 등을 개발하고 있습니다. 그 밖에 일반식품, 건강기능식품, 두유, 의료기기 등도 판매하고 있다. 또한 자동화된 약물 관리 시스템도 제공합니다. 회사는 온·오프라인 약국을 통해 제품을 판매하고 있다. 회사는 이전에 Hanmi Holdings Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2012년 3월에 Hanmi Science Co., Ltd.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Hanmi Science Co., Ltd.는 1973년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"의료 유통","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":1046054210830.0,"operating_income":28111537830.0,"net_income":69209578700.0,"eps":1010.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":1247906379060.0,"operating_income":57011916060.0,"net_income":11512151